        <h1 class="post-detail__title">National Rankings</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/49434.webp" alt="National Rankings" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <div><img data-opt-id=1293851780   alt="Teton Valley Non-Profits, A sturdy brick building proudly displays a sign for the Community Foundation of Teton Valley, symbolizing its pivotal role in fortifying the local community. Neatly trimmed bushes frame the sidewalk, offering a welcoming approach to the foundation’s headquarters. Here, amidst a backdrop of other structures, this organization stands out as a beacon of generosity and support. The Community Foundation of Teton Valley collaborates intimately with local non-profits and businesses, channeling charitable contributions to drive meaningful change and bolster communal resilience. Through strategic grants and dedicated programs, they empower these entities to thrive and address critical needs within Teton Valley, fostering an environment where collective growth and prosperity flourish. The Tin Cup Challenge &amp; Run is the CFTV annual giving event day." decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20525%20700%22%20width%3D%22525%22%20height%3D%22700%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22525%22%20height%3D%22700%22%20fill%3D%22%23f8f5ec%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" alt="" width="225" height="300" /><noscript><img data-opt-id=1293851780  alt="Teton Valley Non-Profits, A sturdy brick building proudly displays a sign for the Community Foundation of Teton Valley, symbolizing its pivotal role in fortifying the local community. Neatly trimmed bushes frame the sidewalk, offering a welcoming approach to the foundation’s headquarters. Here, amidst a backdrop of other structures, this organization stands out as a beacon of generosity and support. The Community Foundation of Teton Valley collaborates intimately with local non-profits and businesses, channeling charitable contributions to drive meaningful change and bolster communal resilience. Through strategic grants and dedicated programs, they empower these entities to thrive and address critical needs within Teton Valley, fostering an environment where collective growth and prosperity flourish. The Tin Cup Challenge &amp; Run is the CFTV annual giving event day." decoding="async" src="https://mlkzvchgqxko.i.optimole.com/cb:Sz1N.d644/w:525/h:700/q:60/g:sm/f:best/https://cftetonvalley.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/IMG_3816.jpg" alt="" width="225" height="300" /></noscript>As we continue to celebrate the 10-year anniversary of the Community Foundation of Teton Valley, we are proud to say that our programs have exceeded all expectations &#8211; providing our local nonprofits with critical, unrestricted operating funds on an annual basis and allowing them to greatly expand the reach of their programs and services throughout our community. In fact, due to our community’s overwhelming support of the Tin Cup Challenge, the Community Foundation of Teton Valley has achieved impressive national rankings when compared to the other 780 Community Foundations operating in the United States.</p>
<p>According to the CF Insights, a service of the <a href="http://cts.vresp.com/c/?CommunityFoundationo/3c776bb72e/c0cd305d0c/3805eba57e" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Foundation Center</a>, the <a href="http://cts.vresp.com/c/?CommunityFoundationo/3c776bb72e/c0cd305d0c/5fc594101d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Community Foundation of Teton Valley</a>, and our affiliate, the <a href="http://cts.vresp.com/c/?CommunityFoundationo/3c776bb72e/c0cd305d0c/d807e3e30e" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Community Foundation of Jackson Hole</a>, were ranked <strong>#1 in the country in 2016</strong> for the <em>Amount of Gifts Received per Capita</em>. This shows that the communities nestled amongst the Tetons are some of the most generous in the nation when it comes to charitable giving, due to the innovative fundraising structure provided by the Tin Cup Challenge and Old Bill’s Run for Charities.</p>
<p>More information: <a href="http://cts.vresp.com/c/?CommunityFoundationo/3c776bb72e/c0cd305d0c/d30c6b0109" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">http://columbussurvey.cfinsights.org/dashboard/tab/top-lists/list/gifts/</a>
<div>
<p>We were also ranked <strong>#1 in the country in 2016</strong> for our <em>Distribution Rate of Grants vs. our Total Assets</em> – meaning that we are amongst the most generous grant makers in the country, annually reinvesting in our nonprofit community in a major way to ensure their success in improving the lives of our residents.</p>
<p>Learn more: <a href="http://cts.vresp.com/c/?CommunityFoundationo/3c776bb72e/c0cd305d0c/bc8d97a3e0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">http://columbussurvey.cfinsights.org/dashboard/tab/top-lists/list/distribution/</a></p>
<div>In short, our Community Foundation receives more support from its residents than any other Community Foundation in the country, and grants that money back out in real time to make an immediate, lasting impact. This means that our donors are part of something amazing! You are the cornerstone of a nationally ranked grant program that is making a HUGE difference in your community. We deeply appreciate your annual philanthropic efforts and for helping to make all of the above possible.
        </div>

